## AMLL TTML Database (optional runtime lyrics source)

NexaMusic includes an independently written provider that requests TTML files on demand
from the AMLL TTML Database (https://github.com/amll-dev/amll-ttml-db). No upstream
database files or lyric text are bundled in the NexaMusic APK or source tree.

The upstream repository states that contributor-authored material is shared under
CC0-1.0, while externally sourced material follows the original data provider's
sharing terms. The CC0 dedication must therefore not be treated as a blanket licence
for every lyric in that database. Availability and permitted use can vary by item and
source. See the upstream README and LICENSE before redistributing any fetched content.

The NexaMusic provider code itself is part of this GPL-3.0 project; it does not copy
or vendor AMLL's renderer or database content.

## Base project

Convx was originally built on an open-source GPL-3.0 music player and has since diverged
completely. It remains licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).
